OL,15,G1300FElis James and John Robins
OL,16,     GJohn is not going to dance to
OL,17,     Gtheir tune. Who's tune? The
OL,18,     Gpeople who design the layouts of
OL,19,     Gsupermarkets. They can play their
OL,20,     Gseductive ditties, but Johnny JR
OL,21,     Gain't dancing.
